diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 978c462d..c56bdead 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -10,7 +10,14 @@ the public-API contract.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
-_Nothing yet._
+### Added
+
+- `LoadOptions.hlsUsesHTTP1` opts an HLS load into strict HTTP/1.1 networking in Debug and
+  Release. It covers admission, relay, ingest, keys, audio tap and renditions while inheriting the
+  host's default DNS privacy context. Default false preserves existing routing; a required relay
+  failure does not recover through another HTTP version or direct AVFoundation requests.
+- Playback-scoped `HLSHTTP1Client` for host admission, and optional real URLSession task metrics,
+  HLS route and Network connection-establishment observers. They do not embed a DNS provider.
 
 ## [7.33.2] - 2026-10-09
 
